                                                "sense_id": "e0b47153-d309-38b5-b527-4019ad258f88",
                                                "text": "The undeveloped or mysterically confused thought which exists in savages is fully exemplified in the childish or crazy atavistic anthropomorphism and symbolism so prevalent among degenerates."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a0a6510b-ba67-3424-8f3c-4e9950d46e88",
                                        "entry_id": "29f939a2-b33e-30e8-972b-de4fb879e058",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An art movement originating in late 19th-century France and Belgium, seeking to represent absolute truths symbolically through language and metaphorical images, mainly as a reaction against naturalism and realism."
                                        ],
